**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/.pub/
**build/
**/.idea/

# Dart VM
**/dump/
**/core/

# Android related
**/android/**/gradle-wrapper.jar
**/android/.gradle
**/android/**/captures
**/android/**/externalNativeBuild**
**/android/**/generated/
**/android/**/google-services.json
**/android/**/release/
