# iOS/XCode related
**/ios/**/.mode1v
**/ios/**/.mode2v
**/ios/**/mode2
**/ios/**/xcodeobjects
**/ios/**/*.ipa
**/ios/**/xcshareddata/
**/ios/**/xcuserdata/
