*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Logs
*.log

# SQLite
*.sqlite3

# Node related
**/node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Do not ignore Isar generated files - they must be committed
!*.g.dart